Error [E0202]: `&` needs a plain named binding after it
  --> tests/ui/write_expression_argument_teaches_binding.jet:6:11
    |
  6 |     edit(&(1 + 2))
    |           ^
 Why: write access (`&`) can only be granted to a named binding, not an expression
 Fix: bind the value first: `x := ...` then pass `&x`
